{"id": "x0103", "pool": "easy-fact", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "It's by Sir Ian McKellen. He wrote it in 19 93, and it' s an autobi ography that covers his life up to the early 1 980s. The book is known for its candid and humorous style, offering insight s into both his personal life and his career in theater, film, and television. Mc Kellen is best known for his roles as Gandalf in the Lord of the Rings films and Magneto in the X-Men series. His writing reflects his wit and his long-standing presence in British culture.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 29, "carrier_ended": null}
